WEBVTT

00:06.360 --> 00:08.240
I don't need any treatment.

00:08.720 --> 00:12.080
It's not your physical state
that I'm worried about.

00:12.160 --> 00:15.560
It's the emotional wounds of your heart
that aches.

00:16.640 --> 00:18.199
I'm certain the pain runs deep.

00:18.879 --> 00:21.719
After all, you just fought a deadly battle
with a close friend...

00:22.519 --> 00:25.039
one fierce enough
that you both used your secret arts.

00:27.079 --> 00:30.120
Zai's technique
is a flurry of attacks at lightning speed

00:30.199 --> 00:32.240
that go beyond the body's limits.

00:32.920 --> 00:36.119
And you countered all of his blows
with your own technique,

00:36.200 --> 00:38.000
the one that gives you super senses
and keen foresight.

00:38.759 --> 00:40.759
How do you know that we used
our secret arts?

00:43.920 --> 00:48.039
I came here...
to explain everything to you.

00:53.520 --> 00:54.560
Chief?

02:51.000 --> 02:52.159
Not my palace...

02:54.840 --> 02:55.960
Dilly.

03:03.759 --> 03:04.800
Dilly...

03:06.599 --> 03:08.120
Thanks for your report.

03:08.199 --> 03:09.840
Seems like another victory for AUZA.

03:10.560 --> 03:13.520
Performance in all departments
continues to improve,

03:13.599 --> 03:15.400
and an upward revision
of your midterms plan

03:15.479 --> 03:17.639
was proposed during
the board meeting earlier today.

03:18.199 --> 03:19.240
I see.

03:20.000 --> 03:21.039
And what are your thoughts on that?

03:22.800 --> 03:25.240
I would never propose
a change to your plans, sir.

03:25.960 --> 03:28.719
And why is that?
Because you're a ninja?

03:29.400 --> 03:30.560
Because you're ex-army?

03:31.479 --> 03:33.599
Or because your duty
is to serve as my secretary?

03:34.120 --> 03:35.120
All of the above.

03:35.759 --> 03:37.759
I am nothing more
than a mere soldier, sir.

03:38.360 --> 03:40.039
Well, that's not what I think.

03:40.879 --> 03:44.120
Poverty, social polarization,
environmental issues...

03:44.879 --> 03:46.000
nobody can solve these problems

03:46.080 --> 03:48.360
because their common sense
always gets in the way.

03:49.039 --> 03:51.879
It takes insanity to make
any real change in the world.

03:52.560 --> 03:55.719
Our role in society is a shackle
that we should just break free from.

03:57.680 --> 04:01.080
Besides, silly, don't you think that makes
life a lot more fun?

04:01.159 --> 04:02.120
Fun, sir?

04:02.599 --> 04:04.719
Why bother doing a job
that you don't enjoy?

04:05.319 --> 04:07.280
Surely you felt that way before.

04:08.240 --> 04:10.280
Let's enjoy ourselves, my friend,

04:11.080 --> 04:13.120
because we are going
to change the world.

04:16.480 --> 04:17.560
That's alright...

04:18.199 --> 04:19.839
since even without AUZA...

04:20.439 --> 04:24.000
the world can definitely be changed
as long as you're still alive.

04:24.560 --> 04:25.759
How idiotic.

04:26.279 --> 04:28.879
The time has come.
His ambitions have met their end.

04:29.399 --> 04:30.480
A new era is here,

04:30.879 --> 04:33.839
and now the ninjas shall take their rule
over everything.

04:35.920 --> 04:38.639
I can't believe you lent an ear
to that fool's nonsense.

04:38.720 --> 04:40.240
It wasn't nonsense.

04:40.839 --> 04:41.839
At least...

04:42.360 --> 04:43.920
not to me!

04:44.600 --> 04:48.600
My time with him changed me,
and now I have faith.

04:49.240 --> 04:51.959
I believe in the power of change
that he brings with him.

04:52.759 --> 04:56.439
He provided everyone in our ranks
with power that transformed us.

04:57.079 --> 04:58.800
It lit a fire within our souls.

04:59.560 --> 05:03.120
And I'm positive the same
must be true for you, Master Yamaji!

05:25.959 --> 05:27.839
A perfected version of the Gusoku gear,

05:28.360 --> 05:29.279
the Mikado?

05:29.839 --> 05:33.199
That man didn't understand
how to wield power properly.

05:33.279 --> 05:36.959
All of these should exist
in the service of our great cause.

05:38.279 --> 05:42.160
We have no emotion, no ego.
We are hollow.

06:29.600 --> 06:31.600
Why have you helped me all this time?

06:34.000 --> 06:35.439
I'm an exiled ninja.

06:35.959 --> 06:37.160
I let myself feel.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.680
I grew a personality.

06:39.399 --> 06:41.240
The ninja code that you instilled
in all of us...

06:41.920 --> 06:43.120
I broke it.

06:46.040 --> 06:48.439
Wasn't the code the be-all end-all?

06:51.040 --> 06:52.360
The code is a curse.

06:54.759 --> 06:56.839
An affliction upon the ninja...

06:57.839 --> 06:59.519
that shackles us all.

07:03.079 --> 07:04.639
Our organization is ancient.

07:05.439 --> 07:09.040
Long ago, we set out to take down all the
other syndicates who rivaled us.

07:09.480 --> 07:11.600
We conquered the underworld,

07:12.160 --> 07:15.360
solidifying our reign over Japan
from the shadows for many ages.

07:16.199 --> 07:17.120
However...

07:17.879 --> 07:21.920
This next assignment clearly
does not require the skills of a ninja.

07:22.680 --> 07:24.160
I suggest that we reject it.

07:25.920 --> 07:29.279
In reality,
there had come a point

07:29.800 --> 07:32.519
where the country of Japan began
to distance itself from us.

07:33.120 --> 07:35.360
There are other special forces teams
we can hire.

07:35.680 --> 07:37.560
Why trust a shady organization like this?

07:39.839 --> 07:41.839
I suppose it was only natural.

07:42.639 --> 07:45.639
It didn't matter how much new technology
we adopted,

07:46.279 --> 07:49.480
because we have always followed
the ancient code,

07:49.560 --> 07:51.920
passed down through the ages
as our cornerstone for existence.

07:52.600 --> 07:55.360
The end seemed inevitable,
given enough time...

07:55.879 --> 07:58.920
so I searched for a new path
that the ninja could walk down.

08:00.120 --> 08:02.000
But... I struggled.

08:03.040 --> 08:04.759
The code is all we have.

08:05.680 --> 08:07.519
We are warriors
who cast aside our emotions

08:07.600 --> 08:10.399
and any sense of self
to live as the shadows of Japan.

08:11.000 --> 08:14.040
I did not know what other path
was feasible.

08:19.480 --> 08:22.319
That was when I realized
I was nothing more

08:22.680 --> 08:26.040
than just another aging ninja
who was trapped by the code.

08:26.600 --> 08:30.079
I was growing desperate,
so I chose to disguise myself.

08:30.160 --> 08:33.080
I began to study the organization
in search of answers.

08:33.159 --> 08:34.480
And that was when...

08:34.960 --> 08:37.759
I came across your loving hearts.

08:39.480 --> 08:40.679
Is something the matter?

08:41.039 --> 08:44.679
I can sense a wavering along
with a subtle calmness.

08:45.679 --> 08:47.440
From within your heart, I mean.

08:48.240 --> 08:50.879
There are waves within
the heart that affect the body.

08:51.639 --> 08:53.080
Yours are quite warm,

08:54.039 --> 08:56.080
which is peculiar for a ninja.

08:56.840 --> 08:59.440
Peculiar for a ninja? Is that so?

09:00.200 --> 09:02.039
Although it's especially true of you,

09:03.000 --> 09:06.080
there are others who I've noticed
exuding similar waves.

09:07.279 --> 09:08.559
There are two of them.

09:09.399 --> 09:12.120
There is nothing wrong with one
who values their comrades.

09:12.879 --> 09:17.679
However, I get the impression
your bonds run much deeper.

09:18.320 --> 09:21.720
In time, you will...
undoubtedly harbor emotions.

09:22.440 --> 09:23.840
I'm not so sure about that.

09:23.919 --> 09:26.879
Will you be reporting this
to the chief before I leave?

09:27.399 --> 09:30.240
- No, I won't say anything.
- Thank you.

09:31.559 --> 09:33.240
But if you continue down this path,

09:34.000 --> 09:36.159
it will lead you to tragedy
sooner or later,

09:37.159 --> 09:39.960
for those who break the code
are doomed to be hunted.

09:41.200 --> 09:43.279
Are you ready to face that fate?

09:45.759 --> 09:48.440
To be honest,
I don't know if I'm ready or not.

09:49.080 --> 09:53.039
However, I don't want to simply
just surrender my life to fate.

09:54.679 --> 09:57.600
If I must follow something,
then I want to follow my heart.

10:00.639 --> 10:02.240
That ninja of the distant past
was stuck living

10:02.320 --> 10:05.039
within a gruesome
back-and-forth competition.

10:05.799 --> 10:09.240
So I imagine this was a change that
never could have occurred back then.

10:09.919 --> 10:12.519
It was a small push into the future

10:13.120 --> 10:15.559
that was brought about
by the passage of time.

10:19.360 --> 10:20.759
I kept watch over your group

10:21.360 --> 10:23.720
as you followed your heart's desires.

10:24.399 --> 10:28.480
A ninja is more than just a warrior
who holds a blade.

10:29.720 --> 10:32.480
They must let their heart guide
their blade.

10:33.600 --> 10:36.399
At least, that's what it felt
like you three were telling me.

10:38.360 --> 10:43.200
But I watched Yamaji too...

10:44.840 --> 10:46.440
and he had different thoughts.

10:46.519 --> 10:49.440
He was also trying
to find a way forward for our clan.

10:49.879 --> 10:53.759
We ninjas have already proceeded
down the magnificent path to the future.

10:54.440 --> 10:56.159
We no longer support a greater power.

10:56.759 --> 10:59.480
We will walk
where we can thrive as ninjas.

11:00.399 --> 11:01.720
That is the way forward.

11:03.480 --> 11:05.120
In our heart of hearts,

11:05.600 --> 11:07.960
every ninja should desire peace
above all else.

11:08.279 --> 11:12.759
Yet the vision you have for the future
will surely result in many sacrifices.

11:13.200 --> 11:16.559
That goes without saying,
but it's all for the ninja cause.

11:17.080 --> 11:20.080
This will bring about a greater peace
for us to cherish.

11:20.639 --> 11:21.960
And in pursuit of that,

11:22.519 --> 11:25.080
I will cast aside everything
that's deemed inessential,

11:25.720 --> 11:27.720
including emotion and ego.

11:29.120 --> 11:31.279
You have let doubt consume you

11:31.759 --> 11:33.759
and now serve no further purpose.

11:34.519 --> 11:35.559
My indecision...

11:36.240 --> 11:38.000
the answer I came up with...

11:39.759 --> 11:41.639
I'm sorry, Master Yamaji.

11:47.200 --> 11:50.759
What he ultimately settled on
was establishing a stricter code,

11:51.480 --> 11:53.639
for becoming completely heartless

11:53.720 --> 11:56.039
is a path that can only lead
to overwhelming power--

11:56.600 --> 12:01.200
and therefore the bright future
for the ninja that I had hoped for...

12:04.240 --> 12:06.879
...never came to bear any fruit.

12:08.240 --> 12:10.039
I was killed by Yamaji

12:10.759 --> 12:12.720
and he took control of the organization,

12:13.200 --> 12:16.639
which promptly set everyone
down a path to the end.

12:21.440 --> 12:22.960
How are you here if he killed you?

12:23.320 --> 12:26.919
You've heard the old saying,
that cats have nine lives.

12:27.879 --> 12:31.080
So now I have lost all my ninja abilities.

12:31.879 --> 12:35.080
For this reason,
I am no longer able to put a stop to him.

12:39.159 --> 12:41.440
We ninjas are bound
by the cruel shackles of fate.

12:41.919 --> 12:45.960
So, please, I want you to use that blade
to cut us all free from them.

12:51.200 --> 12:53.120
I will not fight for the ninja clan.

12:53.759 --> 12:55.120
I wield my blade...

12:56.960 --> 12:58.879
for the sake of all the people...

13:00.679 --> 13:03.080
...who gave me life again.

13:07.080 --> 13:08.879
<i>That was footage of the disaster
from last night.</i>

13:09.200 --> 13:11.000
<i>The entire surrounding area
was devastated</i>

13:11.080 --> 13:13.799
<i>and the citizens of AUZA City
are now being evacuated.</i>

13:14.840 --> 13:17.679
<i>Furthermore, electrical interference
has blocked all communications.</i>

13:24.799 --> 13:28.000
I'm here. So, this is about the data
that Emma found?

13:28.080 --> 13:29.919
- Yep.
- You can give it to me.

13:30.519 --> 13:32.840
If one of your buddies has it,
then you tell me where they are.

13:33.399 --> 13:35.600
I promise I will deal with them
however you'd like me to.

13:35.960 --> 13:37.360
Yeah, that's not going to happen.

13:37.879 --> 13:39.639
I ain't stupid.
I know you'll just suppress it.

13:42.519 --> 13:43.440
What do you want, Mike?

13:43.960 --> 13:45.559
To arrest that scumbag Joseph Evans.

13:46.679 --> 13:48.840
I've decided against relying
on any other agents.

13:49.360 --> 13:52.480
I want you to go out there and be the one
who turns the FBI on its head.

13:53.159 --> 13:55.159
That's why I asked him
to call you in here.

13:58.440 --> 14:00.600
Sounds like you're serious about this,

14:00.679 --> 14:02.600
in which case you're an absolute moron.

14:03.240 --> 14:05.240
Whenever powerful
organizations collude,

14:05.720 --> 14:07.559
the reasoning behind
it is always very complex.

14:08.559 --> 14:10.240
It involves layers upon layers
of all kinds of people

14:10.320 --> 14:11.840
who each reap the benefits
of the agreement.

14:11.919 --> 14:13.799
At this point,
the situation is so messed up

14:14.360 --> 14:18.399
that my influence alone
will not be enough to resolve it.

14:18.480 --> 14:20.000
So just give it up, partner.

14:20.679 --> 14:22.559
We're both old timers, Mike.

14:25.240 --> 14:29.519
I know you've got to understand
how this stuff works by now.

14:30.799 --> 14:32.200
Yeah, of course I do.

14:32.519 --> 14:35.080
Yet I'm here asking you
to take a stand regardless.

14:35.679 --> 14:38.639
You wait. I made sure
I'd have plenty of leverage.

14:40.039 --> 14:42.200
<i>- Urgent report from HQ.
- What?</i>

14:42.679 --> 14:45.399
It appears that private AUZA data
has been leaked onto the web.

14:45.960 --> 14:47.720
It includes detailed information
about the armed ninja organization

14:47.799 --> 14:50.919
that AUZA has been secretly
using and more.

14:51.559 --> 14:54.039
- Mike.
- Just like I planned it.

14:54.799 --> 14:57.240
I told my buddy to upload everything
if he didn't hear from me.

14:57.919 --> 15:00.000
All you've done now
is dig your own grave!

15:00.519 --> 15:03.720
I already told you this won't be enough
to disrupt the balance of power.

15:04.159 --> 15:06.399
Whatever your reasoning
is behind all this collusion,

15:06.799 --> 15:08.360
we'll go and make a reason of our own--

15:09.080 --> 15:10.440
a new one that's way bigger
than all the rest.

15:10.519 --> 15:12.120
The leak also contains a list
of collaborators.

15:12.559 --> 15:14.279
<i>It includes the records
of secret accounts</i>

15:14.679 --> 15:17.720
that various dignitaries
currently hold with AUZA Bank,

15:18.240 --> 15:20.240
but some of the names
have been censored.

15:21.080 --> 15:24.120
Clearly, the censored names
are your bosses here at the FBI,

15:24.600 --> 15:28.360
plus a bigwig who you know is
probably freaking out right about now.

15:34.480 --> 15:36.000
The Secretary of Defense.

15:36.840 --> 15:40.240
She was allowing AUZA
to privately rent the ninjas,

15:40.960 --> 15:42.320
who are technically part of our military.

15:42.399 --> 15:45.360
And I bet there's no way in hell you guys
are going to let that fact be made public.

15:45.840 --> 15:49.320
Are you trying to blackmail us,
the Army and the FBI?

15:49.960 --> 15:51.639
Yeah.
So, how about it?

15:52.159 --> 15:54.600
Is that reason enough
for you to move your ass?

15:56.720 --> 15:58.039
I'm not backing down!

15:58.679 --> 16:00.279
I learned everything I know from you...

16:00.759 --> 16:02.080
about true justice.

16:02.600 --> 16:03.960
That's why I'm here,

16:04.039 --> 16:05.840
risking my life for what's right.

16:06.399 --> 16:08.559
You still have some decency left in you.

16:08.639 --> 16:10.440
Your passion is burned out, man...

16:10.759 --> 16:13.600
...but I know you've been searching,
trying to find a way

16:13.679 --> 16:15.080
to ignite that flame again!

16:24.240 --> 16:25.399
Please.

16:32.879 --> 16:34.240
Turn off the cameras.

16:37.039 --> 16:39.000
You seriously just don't get it.

16:39.840 --> 16:43.360
From my point of view right now,
the side that I choose is justice.

16:44.240 --> 16:46.279
I am not some kind of skeptical pansy

16:46.639 --> 16:48.840
that you can win over
with inspirational speeches.

16:49.480 --> 16:52.200
Learn to give me some credit.
I outrank you.

16:52.639 --> 16:55.360
You haven't changed a bit.
Still the same old asshole.

16:55.799 --> 16:58.240
Yeah, well, this ain't the first time
we've butt heads.

16:58.639 --> 17:01.000
So let's decide this just like old times.

17:01.320 --> 17:02.320
Bring it!

17:20.079 --> 17:21.759
What the hell are they doing?

17:36.440 --> 17:40.599
<i>An online leak revealed that AUZA made
personal use of a ninja military team.</i>

17:40.680 --> 17:45.160
<i>Earlier today,
AUZA's founder, Mr. Joseph Evans,</i>

17:45.240 --> 17:47.240
was issued an arrest warrant by the FBI.

17:47.319 --> 17:48.319
However,

17:48.400 --> 17:52.079
<i>it's been reported that Mr. Evans has
been missing ever since the disas--</i>

17:52.920 --> 17:55.680
I just knew they'd try and cover their
asses, damn ungrateful people.

18:00.920 --> 18:01.920
Fine, then.

18:02.000 --> 18:04.279
Let that be the last stupid decision
they ever make.

18:04.799 --> 18:08.720
Did they seriously think
that I'd just go down without a fight?

18:16.079 --> 18:17.519
I'm devastated right now.

18:18.240 --> 18:21.240
<i>It's so hard to watch you take such
shortsighted action against me.</i>

18:21.559 --> 18:23.039
You seem to have forgotten.

18:23.519 --> 18:24.599
As it stands,

18:24.680 --> 18:28.400
<i>the very fate of the world
as you know it rests solely in my hands.</i>

18:29.240 --> 18:31.920
<i>All I have to do is overload
the AUZA reactors.</i>

18:32.519 --> 18:35.519
<i>The damage of the ensuing explosions
will cover a 100-kilometer radius.</i>

18:36.119 --> 18:38.160
<i>If you make
the wrong choice here,</i>

18:38.240 --> 18:41.359
<i>then this world will be ruined
beyond belief.</i>

18:42.319 --> 18:43.640
This is a statement that was sent out

18:43.720 --> 18:46.839
to the Secretary of Defense
and our bosses at the FBI.

18:47.960 --> 18:49.759
Sounds like it's more than just a threat.

18:50.440 --> 18:52.079
He's probably using this as a distraction.

18:52.160 --> 18:54.680
I bet you anything he's about
to flee the country.

18:55.319 --> 18:56.759
Yeah, and that's not all.

18:56.839 --> 18:59.920
Those bastards from HQ
are taking over our investigation.

19:00.680 --> 19:02.799
They're already hunting Joseph down.

19:02.880 --> 19:05.319
- That doesn't sound good.
- Yeah.

19:06.160 --> 19:09.319
And I bet you they're going to kill him
to keep him quiet for good.

19:14.160 --> 19:15.440
No response
to the warning we issued, sir.

19:15.839 --> 19:17.559
They're proceeding directly
to the southeast.

19:17.640 --> 19:19.000
Hurry and dispatch the drones.

19:19.079 --> 19:21.559
- Take them out now.
- They disappeared.

19:21.640 --> 19:23.400
What? That's impossible.

19:25.839 --> 19:28.119
Mrs. Secretary, we've just got a report
from the Air Force.

19:28.559 --> 19:30.640
What did they say?
Have they found Joseph yet?

19:31.119 --> 19:32.359
No, ma'am, I'm afraid--

20:00.920 --> 20:02.799
This is the start of a new world,

20:03.920 --> 20:06.279
a world that's for the ninja
and by the ninja.

20:06.720 --> 20:09.720
It shall be a place free
from greed and pride,

20:11.599 --> 20:14.119
where the unyielding horizon
that we ninjas have sought

20:14.200 --> 20:16.839
since ancient times awaits.

20:20.920 --> 20:22.880
You can find him in AUZA City.

20:24.119 --> 20:26.880
He's there to prepare for the battle
against the only obstacle

20:26.960 --> 20:28.480
that remains in their way.
You.

20:29.920 --> 20:33.319
We are our own masters from now on.

20:33.799 --> 20:37.079
All the blood and pain
that we have borne to this day

20:37.880 --> 20:40.759
shall give rise to an eternal peace.

20:45.000 --> 20:49.920
Subtitling
FAST TITLES MEDIA
